   "stem_html": "<p><img src=\"exercises/media/b5b5e866881514e8.jpg\" alt=\"Illustration shows differing complexity in cortical folds in brains of rat, cat, chimpanzee, human, and dolphin (from least complex to most complex)\"></p>\n\n<p>If an increased number of folds in the cortical sheets of the brain is associated with increased social complexity, which of the following animals has the greatest social complexity?</p>\n",
